    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Assassinvisible</strong> is a stealth and puzzle game in which your character is invisible -sometimes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207460/extras/77d9fd5191a043daa156bcc3055d812f.avif?t=1734120677\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To avoid dying from boredom in class, Camille decides to draw <strong>your</strong> adventures on her notebook. You're an assassin sneaking around each page's squares to reach their target and erase it forever. Analyze the situations, avoid being spotted by the guards and discover the life of the child drawing your stories through their notebook's margins! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hand-drawn levels (that the kid made, certainly not us) with ever complexifying, unique and intersting situations -absolutly no filler. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An original <i>gameplay</i> where the character is invisible for the enemies, but also for the players! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A touching story told through a pupil's notebook. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your ultimate <strong>revenge</strong> for all those years spent being bored (and having fun) in class.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207460/extras/e8a42135b9482c5acb4cb5b818a866a2.poster.avif?t=1734120677\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207460/extras/e8a42135b9482c5acb4cb5b818a866a2.webm?t=1734120677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207460/extras/e8a42135b9482c5acb4cb5b818a866a2.mp4?t=1734120677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Assassinvisible</strong> is a stealth and puzzle game in which your character is invisible -sometimes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207460/extras/77d9fd5191a043daa156bcc3055d812f.avif?t=1734120677\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To avoid dying from boredom in class, Camille decides to draw <strong>your</strong> adventures on her notebook. You're an assassin sneaking around each page's squares to reach their target and erase it forever. Analyze the situations, avoid being spotted by the guards and discover the life of the child drawing your stories through their notebook's margins! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hand-drawn levels (that the kid made, certainly not us) with ever complexifying, unique and intersting situations -absolutly no filler. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An original <i>gameplay</i> where the character is invisible for the enemies, but also for the players! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A touching story told through a pupil's notebook. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your ultimate <strong>revenge</strong> for all those years spent being bored (and having fun) in class.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207460/extras/e8a42135b9482c5acb4cb5b818a866a2.poster.avif?t=1734120677\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207460/extras/e8a42135b9482c5acb4cb5b818a866a2.webm?t=1734120677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207460/extras/e8a42135b9482c5acb4cb5b818a866a2.mp4?t=1734120677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "short_description": "A cute bite-sized puzzle and stealth game that takes place in the margins of a bored pupil' notebook. You're an invisible assassin, sneak your way past the guards to reach your target and erase it!",
